    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“The last thing anyone thinks before they drown stays in the water with them. You can hear it.”</em></p><p><strong>Tide Recall (1/Short Rest; recharges on Soma Break).</strong> Touch a surface, creature, or object. The GM tells you one true thing from its recent past. The window of what counts as recent scales with your character tier:</p><ul><li>Tier 1 — the last 24 hours.</li><li>Tier 2 — the last week.</li><li>Tier 3 — the last year.</li><li>Tier 4 — anything that ever happened to it.</li></ul><p>The GM may colour the answer; they may not lie.</p>",
